   "prompt": "warm cream paper, soft pencil and colored-pencil storybook illustration, gentle hand-drawn lines. a wide dry grassy field around a still pool, low dry hills in the distance, empty pale sky. a still rectangular pool of water with a stone rim, calm surface. soldiers just arrived and sitting in loose rows on the ground behind their commander at the pool's edge, watching. soldiers just arrived and sitting in loose rows on the ground behind their commander at the pool's edge, watching. twenty-four young men in plain knee-length wool tunics fighting close in the open ground before the pool, twelve young men of Benjamin and twelve young men of David's servants facing each other in matched pairs, each gripping his opponent by the head, a short sword in the other hand. On the left: a sturdy battle-hardened commander in a knee-length undyed wool tunic, a short leather-scale corselet and a wide leather belt, bareheaded, sitting on the ground on the near side of the pool, gripping one spear upright, watching the contest before him, facing right. On the right: a lean quick commander in a knee-length undyed wool tunic, a short leather-scale corselet and a wide leather belt, bareheaded, sitting on the ground on the far side of the pool, gripping a sword hilt at his side, watching the contest before him, facing left."
  },
